   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4118527bcc792b57352e",
   "sourceHash": "4118527bcc792b57352e359ee1a75f77dccdfe194bd0f44ccf310686f6e067db",
   "text": "1. OAP (programme d’Ayurveda d’une journée)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_435dc2eca75897e7252f",
   "sourceHash": "435dc2eca75897e7252fe41fe7a703eaf7c9a0865e0f995b369aed65da63518a",
   "text": "Découvrez les fondamentaux de l’Ayurveda — son histoire, ses principes de base et ses applications au quotidien — à travers une présentation, une démonstration et une séance pratique de massage Abhyangam.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fe7e0ba6a47e06a6bc3d",
   "sourceHash": "fe7e0ba6a47e06a6bc3dcee6fdbdc2ecfb36fd9a416ab44d17e88bce0e885994",
   "text": "2. TAP (programme d’Ayurveda de trois jours)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b11359b3c22e25719ad",
   "sourceHash": "6b11359b3c22e25719ad51c0db99d784fe69c6e3f223ccf481d690e1d05a1545",
   "text": "Approfondissez vos connaissances grâce à un mélange de théorie et de formation pratique, axé sur les thérapies de relaxation et de régénération telles qu’Abhyangam, Shirodhara et Podikizhi.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_529d5f533a76761c669e",
   "sourceHash": "529d5f533a76761c669e3ad1fad491dbb6f1f34e369e5bb8a2d4ce6f166d6533",
   "text": "3. WAP (programme d’Ayurveda de cinq jours)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b89faeb7843203896d81",
   "sourceHash": "b89faeb7843203896d814123cf7ff029f29f0a67a1e1358300951c3b46ab410e",
   "text": "Apprenez les fondamentaux de l’Ayurveda, parallèlement à une formation pratique à cinq thérapies clés : Abhyangam, Shirodhara, Podikizhi, Udhwarthanam et Kativasthi.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9495cc4c611c03cc4184",
   "sourceHash": "9495cc4c611c03cc41843dede947e5d35abb89ec9b55a9a408c7bb9ced09968d",
   "text": "4. AATP (programme d’Ayurveda de 10 jours)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1532e679691c5a277cfd",
   "sourceHash": "1532e679691c5a277cfd8f39ccda56560c0f23f6aa49ae993d84f66c6467137e",
   "text": "Un cursus plus complet couvrant les routines quotidiennes (Dinacharya), les pratiques saisonnières (Ritucharya), l’anatomie et l’application pratique détaillée de six thérapies ayurvédiques essentielles.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c28bdd9926bdc950f816",
   "sourceHash": "c28bdd9926bdc950f816953a37cd1e083a433eb2aca456e987cddbe977da5683",
   "text": "5. AALCT (programme d’Ayurveda de 20 jours)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2268b70a7cfe2f5451cb",
   "sourceHash": "2268b70a7cfe2f5451cb0c12f36c1d1cbe91b5c680e07f7957f82e6196d685f4",
   "text": "Un cours avancé et complet comprenant l’analyse de la Prakriti (constitution corporelle), la prise en charge des troubles liés au mode de vie, des recommandations alimentaires, des remèdes et une formation à neuf grandes thérapies ayurvédiques.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_da4f7ea58d963b1a302b",
   "sourceHash": "da4f7ea58d963b1a302b76b8fa5570190106c673b9cf2975468b8caea5e27384",
   "text": "Remarques :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f8c0fbd6bc413b3982ce",
   "sourceHash": "f8c0fbd6bc413b3982ce5b35458fe43019a7fa042addcf913ba8a9907e780352",
   "text": "Les cours théoriques sont dispensés par des médecins ayurvédiques expérimentés.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
